WinFOSSIL v2.0.0 - Modern FOSSIL Driver
Clean-room GPLv3 recreation of the classic
Windows FOSSIL by Bryan Woodruff (1996).
One unified source, four platforms:
Win9x VxD/DLL, NT VDD, Win32 & x64 DLL.
VMODEM (TCP/Telnet), 26 INT 14h fns,
IP security, system tray, CPL applet.
35 API exports. 50/50 tests pass.
Serial + telnet BBS bridge. o7
